<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" dir="ltr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Explanation Regarding Memberships and Account Activity</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f4f6f8;
      color: #20252b;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 24px;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 760px;
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid #e3e7eb;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 32px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.07);
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #eef2f6;
      color: #53606d;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #39424c;
    }

    .line {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 13px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 24px;
      padding-top: 16px;
      border-top: 1px solid #edf0f2;
      color: #7a848e;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .signature {
      margin-top: 14px;
      color: #39424c;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .name {
      margin-top: 5px;
      font-size: 18px;
      letter-spacing: 0.2px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .account {
      margin-top: 1px;
      direction: ltr;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .username {
      color: #7f8992;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .owner {
      color: #a5adb4;
      margin-left: 6px;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: normal;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      body {
        padding: 12px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 22px 18px;
        border-radius: 14px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 21px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 15px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <main class="card">

    <span class="badge">NOTICE</span>

    <h1>
      Explanation Regarding Memberships and Account Activity
    </h1>

    <p>

      <span class="line">
        I have no connection, affiliation, or collaboration with any of the channels or groups in which my account is a member.
      </span>

      <span class="line">
        Membership in some of these spaces was solely for the purpose of accessing educational materials, study resources, and other content required for personal use.
      </span>

      <span class="line">
        Some memberships were also the result of using bots that require users to join certain channels in order to access files or other content.
      </span>

      <span class="line">
        These memberships were solely intended to provide access to the required content. After obtaining the content, I left the relevant channels whenever further membership was no longer necessary.
      </span>

      <span class="line">
        Any content published in these channels or groups does not represent my personal views, positions, opinions, or activities.
      </span>

      <span class="line">
        The presence of my account in a channel or group, by itself, does not constitute participation in, affiliation with, collaboration with, or endorsement of that channel or group's activities or content.
      </span>

      <span class="line">
        This statement is provided solely to prevent any misunderstanding regarding the nature of these memberships and their relationship to my personal activities.
      </span>

    </p>

    <footer>

      This page has been created for informational purposes only.

      <div class="signature">

        Respectfully,

        <div class="name">
          Matin
        </div>

        <div class="account">
          <span class="username">@Medoralll</span>
          <span class="owner">· Account Owner</span>
        </div>

      </div>

    </footer>

  </main>

</body>
</html>
